<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: EU ministers break for lunch, no deal yet - EU source.</title>
<headline>EU ministers break for lunch, no deal yet - EU source.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU finance ministers have broken for lunch from talks on a pact to enforce fiscal discipline after monetary union, with no sign of a deal yet, an EU source said.</p>
<p>The source said there was no suggestion that the ministers had reached any conclusions on the pact. Germany is holding out for tighter rules on the circumstances in which countries running big budget deficits should be able to claim exemption from fines.</p>
</text>
